Package: ma
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, adduser
Recommends: logrotate
Description: decentralised ma runtime daemon
 The ma runtime hosts Wasm entities, publishes its did:ma identity through
 IPFS/IPNS, and exchanges signed, encrypted messages over iroh.
